{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Leaflet 把筆記、計劃與會議記錄整理成可離線使用的區塊頁面，適合需要在 iPhone 與 iPad 上以 AI 協助編輯內容、錄音及轉錄的用戶。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-245.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>區塊筆記與智能代理協作</h2>\n<p>Leaflet 內建區塊編輯器，可整理標題、清單、待辦、表格、程式碼、圖片與影片，並支援 Markdown 快捷鍵、範本、標籤、搜尋及頁面歷史。頁面會先儲存在裝置，離線亦可使用。用戶可在頁面內、選取內容、聊天或留言串呼叫 AI 代理，讓它讀取頁面並以可驗證工具編輯，每次操作可一次復原；亦可連接 OpenAI、Claude 或 Ollama 等自選模型。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-301-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-302-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-303-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-304-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-305-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-306-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Leaflet: Notes &amp; Agents</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/leaflet-notes-agents/id6829665849?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T17:44:25.624988+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":349,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T17:21:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T05:57:41.153116+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T17:37:51.705728+00:00","content_hash":"f1407cbd645f3fa35fbf267c2f1876325b2e0ddd5655c1da7afb2e0ff077ef79","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}